@startuml
actor User
boundary "views/declares/show.html.erb" as View
control "DeclaresController" as Controller
entity "Declare Model" as Model
database "Database" as DB

User -> View: Request to view declare
View -> Controller: Send GET /declares/:id request
Controller -> Model: Find declare by ID
Model -> DB: Query declare by ID
DB --> Model: Return declare object
Model --> Controller: Pass declare object
Controller -> View: Render declare show page
View -> User: Display declare details
@enduml
